/* CUTSCENE_OBJECT's TEN pointer-to-member STATE tables, hosted as ADDRESS
 * SWITCHES -- run link100, lane TAIL2.
 *
 * GENERATED by port/tools/tail2_gen_states.py out of the ROM; do not hand-edit
 * the tables. Every {ROM address, host body} row is read from
 * extracted/overlays/overlay_0002.bin and cross-checked against
 * config/arm9/overlays/ov002/relocs.txt by port/tools/tail2_cells.py, which
 * refuses on any cell whose image word and relocation disagree, whose
 * this-adjustment is not zero, or whose array has a hole. All three checks
 * pass on this tree with zero defects; the report is out/TAIL2/cells.tsv.
 *
 * ---- WHAT THE ROM ACTUALLY HAS ---------------------------------------------
 *
 * data_ov002_0210b650..0x0210b8b8 are NOT vtables. They are eight-byte mwcc
 * pointer-to-member cells, {function, this-adjustment}, and
 * __sinit_ov002_02107370 (matched, slice_gate10.txt:443) copies SIXTY-NINE of
 * them into ov002 bss as ten State arrays that tile 0x02110e24..0x0211104c
 * with no gap:
 *
 *     0x02110e24   2 cells   func_ov002_020f3310    (C::*)(int)
 *     0x02110e34   3 cells   func_ov002_020f3d98    (C::*)(int)
 *     0x02110e4c   3 cells   func_ov002_020f37a0    (C::*)(int)
 *     0x02110e64   3 cells   func_ov002_020f5848    (C::*)(int)
 *     0x02110e7c   4 cells   func_ov002_020f5990    (C::*)(int)
 *     0x02110e9c   4 cells   func_ov002_020f3740    (C::*)(int)
 *     0x02110ebc   6 cells   func_ov002_020f2dd4    (C::*)(int)
 *     0x02110eec   9 cells   func_ov002_020f562c    (C::*)(int)
 *     0x02110f34  13 cells   func_ov002_020f5dd8    (C::*)()
 *     0x02110f9c  22 cells   func_ov002_020f5f0c    (C::*)()
 *
 * The class that owns them is CUTSCENE_OBJECT (actor 0x160 = 352, ov002,
 * hal/actor_classes_intro.cpp): src/_ZN14CutsceneObject13InitResourcesEv.cpp
 * is what reaches this family, and the ten readers are all ov002 bodies inside
 * its closure. Sixty-six of the sixty-nine cells name a MATCHED body; the
 * fifty-four distinct ones among them were unlinked before this file.
 *
 * ---- WHY AN ADDRESS SWITCH AND NOT AN MSVC MEMBER POINTER -------------------
 *
 * The gate-16 wall, the same one hal/intro_kuppa_dispatch.cpp's two live
 * dispatchers already stand behind. mwcc lays a pointer-to-member out as two
 * words; MSVC forms one over an INCOMPLETE class as the four-word GENERAL
 * representation, so `arr[i]` reads sixteen bytes out of an eight-byte record
 * -- the cell and its neighbour -- and then uses neighbour data as the
 * this-adjustment and the virtual-base index. Compiled as written the ten
 * readers link, look fine and call a wrong address quietly. FIVE of them were
 * therefore TRAPPED (hal/intro_kuppa_dispatch.cpp's tail, retired by this
 * file) and five were in no slice at all.
 *
 * What runs instead is exactly what the fourteen- and twenty-four-slot command
 * dispatchers next door do: read the ROM's own two-word record, check the
 * function word against the address the host body was compiled from, refuse on
 * a disagreement, and call the host body. THE MOUNTED BYTES ARE NEVER
 * REWRITTEN, so there is no seat ordering to get wrong -- the first dispatch
 * resolves the cell -- and a wrong mount is loud instead of fatal-later.
 *
 * THAT IS ALSO WHY THERE IS NO __fastcall THUNK ANYWHERE IN THIS FILE, and the
 * distinction is worth stating because the neighbouring seats are full of them.
 * A seat that REWRITES a cell hands the host address to MSVC's own PMF call,
 * whose convention is the SITE's and has to be measured (CMakeLists R11: the
 * failure is silent). An address switch never lets MSVC form a member pointer
 * at all -- this file reads the record and makes an ordinary __cdecl call --
 * so there is no convention to get wrong.
 *
 * PORT_HOST_ABI: mwcc pointer-to-member dispatch; MSVC's PMF over an
 * incomplete class is the wider general representation. See the header.
 *
 * ---- THREE CELLS HAVE NO MATCHED TU AND SAY SO -----------------------------
 *
 * data_ov002_02110eec[2], [6] and [8] name func_ov002_020f5010,
 * func_ov002_020f43cc and func_ov002_020f3de4. There is no src/ file for any of
 * the three anywhere in the tree (they are not guess-marked, they are simply
 * not decompiled), so those three indices abort by name rather than run a body
 * this file would have had to invent. The other sixty-six cells are matched.
 */
#include <cstdio>
#include <cstdlib>

